<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Greek Mobile Plans Compared 2026 — Cosmote, Vodafone, Nova, prepaid &amp; contract</title>
<meta name="description" content="Compare every mobile plan in Greece by price, data, minutes and SMS. Cosmote, Vodafone, Nova, What's Up, Frog and Free2Go — contract and prepaid, with real cost per gigabyte.">
